# 📊 New Zealand Sales & Profit Dashboard

## Project Overview
This Power BI dashboard analyzes sales and profit performance using interactive visualizations.

## Tools Used
- Power BI
- CSV Dataset

## Dashboard Features
- Total Sales
- Total Profit
- Total Orders
- Average Sales
- Monthly Sales Trend
- Sales by Region
- Sales & Profit by Category
- Profit by Region
- Interactive Slicers

